  nothing here: the name is internal, the URL is what a visitor sees.

  V1 IS PRESERVED, NOT DELETED. It is still published at
  `/pages/first-access-v1` on its own `page.first-access-campaign` template,
  with `seo.hidden = 1` so it stays out of the sitemap, storefront search
  and search engines. No redirect points at it.

